## Never

- Merge into `{{production_branch}}`, create a tag or deploy production — prepare the commands for the user.
- Commit on `{{protected_branches}}` or force-push a shared branch.
- Discard or overwrite the user's uncommitted changes.
- Promote between environments with cherry-pick.
- Commit a secret.

